### ─── Health ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ─── Auth: Core ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!",
  "name": "John Doe"
}

### Login (email or username)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### Login with username
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "johndoe",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Forgot Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com"
}

### Reset Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "00118d65-165d-4ce8-a759-94e837e093a5",
  "password": "Newpassword1!"
}

### ─── Auth: Magic Link ────────────────────────────────────

### Request Magic Link
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/magic-link
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com"
}

### Verify Magic Link (use token from email)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/magic-link/verify?token=TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL

### ─── Auth: Login OTP ─────────────────────────────────────

### Send Login OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/login/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com"
}

### Verify Login OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/login/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

### ─── OTP / Email Verification ────────────────────────────

### Send Registration OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/otp/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com"
}

### Verify Registration OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/otp/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "code": "123678"
}

### ─── Profile ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload Avatar
POST {{baseUrl}}/me/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----avatar

----avatar
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-avatar.jpg
----avatar--

### ─── User Management (Admin) ─────────────────────────────

### List Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "Newuser1!",
  "name": "New User",
  "roles": "user"
}

### Show User
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update User
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "roles": "user"
}

### Delete User
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── Social Auth (Google) ────────────────────────────────

### Google Login (redirects to Google)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/google/authorize

### Google Callback (redirect from Google)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/google/callback?code=<authorization-code>&state=<state>
